{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>From the fruit of his mouth, a man shall eat</b> — it stands in place of two [verbs], and likewise: מפרי פיהו יאכל איש טוב — that a good reward is paid to him." "<b>But the soul of traitors shall eat violence</b> — from the hand of one who oppresses, or the violence they themselves do."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:22:28.328682927Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}